  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="950cdc22-9d50-56ee-b044-cb04366c2cef" activityNameId="e7199e10-148c-5871-9a8c-4d38fbcc6f8d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Flat plate collector for PVT, aluminium copper absorber, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Flat plate collector for PVT, aluminium copper absorber, at plant
One collector has an aparture area of 2.335 m2 and an empty weight of 42 kg. The dataset refers to 1 m2 aparture area, which is equal to 1.09 m2 collector area. The flat plate collector has a selective nickel pigmented aluminium oxide coating on an aluminium absorber.;
Synonyms: Solarkollektor / Plattenabsorber nur für PVT-Systeme, flat plate collector for PVT systems only!; 
UUID: a41f905b-d832-3044-b525-5e4db63906d7
Production and disposal of a flat plate collector for PVT system ONLY with am aluminium absorber in Switzerland. Including materials, water and energy use of production. Materials for mounting on roof are excluded.
Location: Production in CH. Main components are imported from the Germany.
Technology: Modern production plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer,  environmental reports, direct contacts with factory representatives and publication of plant data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a41f905b-d832-3044-b525-5e4db63906d7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
